Recommends: pcmanfm-qt, qterminal, network-manager-gnome, pavucontrol-qt, papirus-icon-theme, lxqt-session, xfwm4 | openbox, picom, bluez, brightnessctl, dbus-bin, pkexec
Suggests: sddm | lightdm
Description: Edukasaun Desktop 0.9.17 - Eduka-Settings, smart Action Center and notifications
 Edukasaun Desktop, Eduka-Menu, Eduka-Settings and Eduka-Panel.
 Eduka-Settings configures the whole desktop (theme, icons, cursor, panel,
 clock, notifications and the SDDM login screen with live preview). The
 Action Center has a big digital or analog clock with greetings, a smart
 network tile, a resizable calendar and the session buttons; Eduka-Panel is
 the notification server. One standard account edukasaun for the live
 system.
